Package: droopescan
Version: 1.45.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/droope/droopescan
Description: CMS scanner for Drupal, WordPress, Silverstripe and Joomla
 droopescan performs automated fingerprinting and vulnerability checks
 against Content Management Systems (Drupal, WordPress, Silverstripe
 and Joomla) with zero false-positive reporting. It checks for
 enumerable users, plugins, themes, modules, and known CVEs based on
 version fingerprinting.
